      <h2 id="nvidia-gpu-prerequisites_nvidia-gpu-architecture" class="group scroll-mt-20">NVIDIA GPU prerequisites<a href="#nvidia-gpu-prerequisites_nvidia-gpu-architecture" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
