      <li><a href="https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/openshift/latest/time-slicing-gpus-in-openshift.html">Time-slicing NVIDIA GPUs in OpenShift</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/openshift/latest/mirror-gpu-ocp-disconnected.html">Deploy GPU Operators in a disconnected or airgapped environment</a></li>
